# --- Build artifacts (regenerable, large: target can be many GB) ---
/target/
**/target/

# --- Node / frontend build ---
**/node_modules/
ui/dist/

# --- Tauri generated (schemas/capabilities are regenerated by the build) ---
src-tauri/gen/

# --- Runtime case data / lakes / read models / secrets ---
# These are created if a DFIR case is opened with the repo root as the workspace.
# Never commit evidence-derived data or the runtime signing key.
taotie-data/
taotie3-data/
**/lake/
**/read_models/
**/raw/objects/
**/indexes/
**/meta/report_signing_key.json
**/meta/jobs.sqlite
**/_projection_version

# --- Stray/embedded repos & scratch dirs (not part of the project) ---
_sizetest_/

# --- Local agent/assistant instructions (never publish) ---
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# NOTE: Cargo.lock (x2) and ui/package-lock.json are intentionally committed.
